    <briefdescription>
<para>HOLIDAYS(...) - Get holidays from calendar or create inline array. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Can be used in two ways:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Load from registered calendar: HOLIDAYS(&quot;DE_2024&quot;)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Create inline from dates: HOLIDAYS(&quot;2024-12-25&quot;, &quot;2024-12-26&quot;)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Merge multiple calendars: HOLIDAYS(&quot;DE_2024&quot;, &quot;company_holidays&quot;)</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>Examples: HOLIDAYS(&quot;DE_2024&quot;) // Load German holidays 2024 HOLIDAYS(&quot;DE_2024&quot;, &quot;AT_2024&quot;) // Merge German and Austrian HOLIDAYS(&quot;2024-12-25&quot;, &quot;2024-12-26&quot;) // Inline dates </para>
    </detaileddescription>
